Package: CLEAR
Type: Package
Title: Cell-type and Lineage-resolved Enhancer Architecture from GWAS-snATAC
Version: 0.90
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lefei", "Wang", email = "lefei.wang@qimrberghofer.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Quantifies cell-type and lineage specificity of chromatin
    accessibility at GWAS variant loci. Provides L2-based specificity scores,
    dominance and threshold-consensus metrics, lineage hierarchy construction,
    and locus-level concordance testing for credible-causal variant peaks
    against single-nucleus ATAC-seq reference matrices.
